{"type": "concept", "subtype": "definition", "title": "课程定位：专注父母而非孩子", "content": "本课程不是教父母如何教孩子的课程，而是专注父母自身的课程。课程主要目标是提升父母自身，即打地基，而不是建造房子（即直接改变孩子）。", "steps": [], "conditions": [], "limits": [], "modules": ["自我修养"], "tags": ["课程定位", "父母成长"], "evidence": "course_claim", "risk_flags": [], "id": "s-07be3270f44d-c001:a001", "source_refs": [{"source_id": "s-07be3270f44d", "blocks": ["b00005"], "source_kind": "A1"}], "review_status": "point_source_reviewed", "version": "2026-11-05.full-1", "relations": [{"target": "s-07be3270f44d-c001:a002", "kind": "supports", "condition": "无", "reason": "课程定位（专注父母自身）通过养育比喻（父母是地基）来支持，说明父母自身提升是基础。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis"}, {"target": "s-07be3270f44d-c001:a003", "kind": "step_of", "condition": "无", "reason": "学习期间将眼光注视自己是实现课程定位（专注父母自身）的具体步骤，原方向反了，应为注视自己作为课程定位的步骤。", "evidence": "knowledge_synthesis", "review_status": "revised", "review_notes": "方向反了。"}, {"target": "s-07be3270f44d-c001:a012", "kind": "same_source_point", "condition": "Read both records and the shared source point; this is not a causal assertion.", "reason": "s-07be3270f44d-c001:u4", "evidence": "point_source_review"}, {"target": "s-07be3270f44d-c001:v2-n001", "kind": "association", "condition": "无特定条件", "reason": "候选说明课程专注父母，与源并列，仅同属课程介绍。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "s-07be3270f44d-c001:v2-n002", "kind": "complements", "condition": "无特定条件", "reason": "候选明确课程定位专注父母而非孩子，与源初衷一致，补充了目标的表述。", "evidence": "source_atom_relationship_review"}, {"target": "legacy:zz-r-12", "kind": "equivalent", "condition": "当定位干预入口时，与旧原子'父母自身是干预入口，而非只改孩子'一致。", "reason": "候选明确课程专注父母自身，目标是提升父母，与旧原子核心结论等价。", "evidence": "cross_library_review"}], "knowledge_units": ["s-07be3270f44d-c001:u4"], "retrieval_scope": "knowledge", "knowledge_layer": "expanded", "alternate_titles": []}
